 "notes": [
  "All four tables exist only as JPG images on stats.gov.cn (.xls/.xlsx/.htm returned 404); values transcribed by reading 2x-upscaled image crops. All cells were legible; no nulls.",
  "Averages computed as 基金支出(亿元)*1e8 / 人数(万人)*1e4, rounded to whole yuan per year. Denominator is year-end headcount, so this is approximate (ignores mid-year changes; fund expenditure may include small non-benefit items such as transfers).",
  "t24_26 includes an extra row '不分地区' (central government organs, PBoC, ADBC and the central adjustment fund account), per table footnote; it is included in rows and in averages.",
  "t24_26 participants = 职工 + 离退休人员 checked for every row.",
  "t22_16 row 西藏 0-6岁眼保健覆盖率 = 67.7 is far below others but is what the table shows.",
  "t21_12 is national only; rows by level 普通小学/初中.",
  "Transcription check: for t24_26 (provinces + 不分地区) and t24_27 (provinces), every column sums to the 全国 row within ±0.3 (rounding); t21_12 sub-columns sum exactly to totals."
 ],
 "gaps": [
  "22-16 has no infant mortality, under-5 mortality or low-birth-weight columns; it only has 4 child health-management coverage rates. Mortality would need another table (e.g. 22-x 监测地区孕产妇和儿童死亡率, national/urban/rural only).",
  "21-12 has no provincial breakdown and no 高中 level."
 ]
}